      "html": "<div class='close-card'><h1 class='close-title'><span class='close-w' style='display:inline-block;white-space:pre'>Decide </span><span class='close-w' style='display:inline-block;white-space:pre'>what </span><span class='close-w' style='display:inline-block;white-space:pre'>happens </span><span class='close-w' style='display:inline-block;white-space:pre'>next, </span><span class='close-w' style='display:inline-block;white-space:pre'>before </span><span class='close-w' style='display:inline-block;white-space:pre'>it </span><span class='close-w' style='display:inline-block;white-space:pre'>happens.</span></h1><div class='close-bar'></div><p class='sub close-sub'>Gateway \u00b7 open source \u00b7 Rust library</p><p class='mono close-url'>sensei-hq.com/articles/fallback-chains</p></div>",
      "id": "card",
